      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors observed 41 patients with pseudotuberculosis. In 32 patients, the abdominal syndrome predominated in the clinical course. For this reason, the appendectomy was performed in 30 of them. In 9 patients, the lingering, relapsing course of pseudotuberculosis was noted after the operation."},
